{"id":1,"titleZh":"什么是音乐的含义？","titleEn":"What Does Music Mean?","date":"1958-01-18","dateZh":"1958 年 1 月 18 日","concepts":"纯音乐含义、音程张力、大小调转换","thesis":"音乐并不描写具体的人或故事，它表达的只是音符排列后让人产生的纯粹情绪。","plain":"文字说“火箭”就会让人想到物体，但单独一个升 F 音什么也代表不了。曲名和故事只是外加的标签，音乐之所以动人，全靠音符之间的拉扯、音量推高和小调转大调带来的情绪起伏。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦先请乐队奏《威廉·退尔》序曲，请首席小提琴手现场拉出“马蹄奔跑”的顿弓感，指出同一段旋律换个人也能听出完全不同的画面。","假故事对照实验：放理查·施特劳斯《堂吉诃德》前，他先现编了一个“超人骑摩托救囚犯”的荒诞故事配乐解说；接着揭晓原曲其实是绵羊叫和骑士冒险并重听一遍——故事全变，音乐本身照样好听。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1tJ411r7gh","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tJ411r7gh","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 音乐的意义是什么","duration":"59:19","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-does-music-mean","repertoire":[{"composer":"Rossini","piece":"William Tell Overture","titleZh":"威廉·退尔序曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/ba/1d/16/ba1d1694-e874-3ef3-0c4e-33989896a9b7/mzaf_6570385965075423882.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/william-tell-overture/196768933?i=196776465&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Leonard Bernstein & New York Philharmonic","recordingTrack":"William Tell Overture","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Rossini%20William%20Tell%20Overture+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Rossini%20William%20Tell%20Overture"},{"composer":"Richard Strauss","piece":"Don Quixote","titleZh":"堂吉诃德","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/f5/fc/b5/f5fcb5d4-4264-d8fc-f82b-9d3d316de913/mzaf_3486066148976923853.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/don-quixote-op-35-introduction/212959505?i=212959516&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Antonio Janigro, Chicago Symphony Orchestra, Fritz Reiner, John Weicher & Milton Preves","recordingTrack":"Don Quixote, Op. 35: Introduction","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Richard